<title>PORTUGAL: Bank of Portugal injects 160.868 bln esc, 7.10 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Portugal injects 160.868 bln esc, 7.10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 160.868 billion escudos of 10-day funds into the money market at a fixed rate of 7.10 percent in a repurchase tender effective tomorrow at the start of a new commercial bank reserve period.</p>
<p>The rate compared with 7.25 percent previously.</p>
<p>-- LISBON BUREAU 3511-3538254</p>
